PART 1: OVERVIEW OF THE LESSON
================================================================================

WHAT YOU'LL LEARN IN THIS LESSON
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This lesson focuses on understanding and implementing controlled form
elements in React.

You will understand:

• What controlled elements are

• How controlled elements work

• Controlled vs uncontrolled elements

• Controlled text inputs

• Controlled textareas

• Controlled select dropdowns

• Controlled checkboxes

• Controlled radio buttons

• Managing multiple controlled fields

• Creating a reusable change handler

• Best practices for controlled forms

