================================================================================
WHY checked={choice === value}?
================================================================================

Suppose:

choice = 'option-b'


Option A:

checked={
  'option-b' === 'option-a'
}

=
false


Option B:

checked={
  'option-b' === 'option-b'
}

=
true


Option C:

checked={
  'option-b' === 'option-c'
}

=
false


Therefore only the matching option appears selected.


================================================================================
RADIO GROUP ACCESSIBILITY
================================================================================

For a related radio-button group, using:

<fieldset>
  <legend>...</legend>
</fieldset>


clearly groups the related choices.

All radio inputs in the group should also use the same:

name="choice"


