BENEFIT 3: DEPENDENT FIELDS
================================================================================

Example:

country
   ↓
Determines available states/provinces


Another example:

accountType
     ↓
Show/Hide Company Name


Because current values are state-driven, rendering can depend on them.


================================================================================
BENEFIT 4: PROGRAMMATIC UPDATES
================================================================================

Example reset:

