  INITIAL_FORM
)


Example pre-fill:

setFormData({

  firstName:
    'Parag',

  lastName:
    'Tayade',

  country:
    'india',

  subscribe:
    true

})


================================================================================
BENEFIT 5: DERIVED UI
================================================================================

State:

message


Can drive:

• Character Count

• Word Count

• Remaining Characters

• Validation Message

• Submit Button State


No duplicate state is required if those values can be calculated.


================================================================================
BENEFIT 6: TESTABILITY
================================================================================

A user-oriented test can:

1. Render form

2. Type text

3. Select an option

4. Check a checkbox

5. Verify visible output


This tests the same interaction the user performs.


