================================================================================
GENERIC CONTROLLED-FORM PATTERN
================================================================================

1. STATE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const [formData, setFormData] =
  useState({

    name: '',

    country: '',

    subscribe: false,

    choice: ''

  })


2. HANDLER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const handleChange = (
  event
) => {

  const {
    name,
    value,
    type,
    checked
  } = event.target


  const nextValue =
    type === 'checkbox'
      ? checked
      : value


  setFormData(previous => ({

    ...previous,

    nextValue

  }))
}


3. TEXT INPUT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

<input
  name="name"
  value={formData.name}
  onChange={handleChange}
/>


4. SELECT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

<select
  name="country"
  value={formData.country}
  onChange={handleChange}
>
  ...
</select>


5. CHECKBOX
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

<input
  type="checkbox"
  name="subscribe"
  checked={formData.subscribe}
  onChange={handleChange}
/>


6. RADIO
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

<input
  type="radio"
  name="choice"
  value="option-a"
  checked={
    formData.choice ===
    'option-a'
  }
  onChange={handleChange}
/>


================================================================================
CONTROLLED VS UNCONTROLLED QUICK REFERENCE
================================================================================

CONTROLLED:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

React State
    ↓
value / checked
    ↓
Form Control
    ↓
onChange
    ↓
State Update


UNCONTROLLED:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DOM Owns Current Value
        ↓
Read When Needed
        ↓
ref / FormData / DOM Form APIs


Neither pattern is universally correct for every form.

Choose according to application requirements.


================================================================================
QUICK REVISION TABLE
================================================================================

+------------------------+----------------------------------------------+
| CONCEPT                | REMEMBER                                     |
+------------------------+----------------------------------------------+
| Controlled Input       | React state drives current value             |
| value                  | Text/select/textarea control                 |
| checked                | Checkbox/radio control                       |
| onChange               | Processes user interaction                   |
| target.value           | String value from many controls              |
| target.checked         | Boolean checkbox state                       |
| name                   | Identifies field in generic handler          |
| [name]                 | Computed property                            |
| Spread                 | Preserves other object properties            |
| Functional Setter      | Build next object from previous object       |
| Radio Group            | One selected state value                     |
| fieldset/legend        | Semantic grouping for related controls       |
| Derived Value          | Calculate from form state when possible      |
| File Input             | Read through files                           |
+------------------------+----------------------------------------------+


